Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.46,0:00:13.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,《百年孤独》
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Hola?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.08,0:01:27.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚住在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:27.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Es la casa de José Arcadio Buendía?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.38,0:01:29.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:29.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,怎么了 阿玛兰妲？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenas.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡在一个星期天到来
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.38,0:01:43.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她跟着几个皮货商人历尽艰难才从马瑙雷来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:43.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Había hecho el penoso viaje desde Manaure con unos traficantes de pieles
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,皮货商受人之托
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que recibieron el encargo de entregarla
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,护送她和她父母的遗骨…
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.50,0:01:50.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,上面写了什么？
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,说她是我们的远房表亲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Que es prima nuestra en yo no sé qué grado.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她是我那位难忘的朋友尼卡诺尔·乌略亚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Hija del inolvidable Nicanor Ulloa
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.71,0:01:57.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,和他高贵妻子丽贝卡·蒙铁尔的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:57.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,y su noble esposa Rebeca Montiel.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.17,0:01:59.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谁的女儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:01:59.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Hija de quién?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.96,0:02:04.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,…但他们说不清楚委托人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:04.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,la persona que les había pedido el favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo te llamas?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Tienes hambre?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 阿尔卡蒂奥搬去跟你睡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, Arcadio desde hoy duerme contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-好-比西塔西翁 准备洗澡水
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno. Visitación, prepara un baño.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我能搬去奥雷里亚诺的房间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y si soy yo quien duerme con Aureliano?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.04,0:02:42.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不行 阿尔卡蒂奥是大男孩了该他搬过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:42.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No, Arcadio ya está en edad de dormir con tu hermano.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.67,0:02:44.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,拿条你的旧裙子过来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:44.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Busca un vestido que no utilices y tráelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.88,0:02:45.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:45.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero…
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.33,0:02:49.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这家里太多男人了多一个姑娘挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:49.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Con tanto hombre en esta casa, no es nada malo tener una hermana.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你也有个可以谈心的小姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y uno con las hermanas comparte hasta la sopa. ¿Entiendes?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.67,0:02:52.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.12,0:02:53.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,帮我收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:53.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ayúdame.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,拿条裙子来 阿玛兰妲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Y el vestido, Amaranta!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.75,0:03:16.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,骨头？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:16.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Huesos?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.54,0:03:19.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,对 好多骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:19.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí… muchos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别让我再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No te lo pediré otra vez.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.04,0:03:23.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:23.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.21,0:03:34.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这个家什么时候成孤儿院了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:34.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No sé en qué momento se convirtió esta casa en un orfanato.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.88,0:03:40.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,有了阿尔卡蒂奥还不够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:40.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Como si no fuera suficiente con Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.71,0:03:52.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺耐心地把所有圣人的名字念给她听
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:52.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,de leer frente a ella todo el santoral
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但她没有丝毫反应
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,y no logró que reaccionara con ningún nombre.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,露西亚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Lucía.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,多洛蒂亚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Dorotea.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,伊奈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Inés.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.33,0:04:09.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,也许她是聋哑人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:09.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y si es sordomuda?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就叫丽贝卡 随她妈妈的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pues sordomuda o no, se va a llamar Rebeca como su madre. Y punto.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.71,0:04:14.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,让她吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:14.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ahora déjenla comer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们两个！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Niños!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,知道被妈妈发现会有什么后果吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Saben lo que pasa si mamá los pesca?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,回屋睡觉去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Váyanse a dormir.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我不困
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Todavía no tengo sueño.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.79,0:05:09.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:09.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mentira.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是害怕那个怪女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tienes miedo de dormir con la rara.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.04,0:05:16.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,才不是呢你跟她一样 都是没爹没娘的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:16.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Claro que no. Y no hables que eres igual a ella. ¿Dónde están tus papás?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Amaranta!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我可以睡你的房间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Puedo dormir en tu cuarto?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,回你自己房间去 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Anda al tuyo, no pasa nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.42,0:05:41.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,来吧 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:41.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ven, ven conmigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.92,0:05:46.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:46.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Lo reconoces?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（犰狳）
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,犰狳？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Armadillo?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,它的英文以字母“A”开头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Su nombre empieza con la letra A.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,和你的名字一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Igual que el tuyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,“A”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,"A".
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,认识这个字母吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Sabes cuál es esta letra?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.71,0:06:03.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,“B”？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:03.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿La B?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.96,0:06:05.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:05.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Muy bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡蒂奥 该睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ya es hora, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.46,0:06:12.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们明天再继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:12.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mañana seguimos.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.29,0:06:16.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:16.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Hasta mañana.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是嫌光有你父亲整天待在这里还不够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿No crees que ya teníamos suficiente con tu papá acá metido?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不过是多一张嘴吃饭的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Donde comen siete, comen ocho.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.79,0:06:45.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她还什么都没吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:45.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No ha querido comer nada desde que llegó.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.38,0:06:47.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一口都没吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:47.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ni un bocado.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.00,0:06:51.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别担心 她饿了自然会跑来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:51.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tranquila. Cuando le suenen las tripas, va a venir a buscarte.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.67,0:06:54.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我担心的不是丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:54.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es que no es Rebeca lo que me preocupa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.92,0:06:56.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:56.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es Aureliano.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.79,0:07:05.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,自从他哥哥离开后他就没出过那该死的实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:05.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No ha querido salir de ese maldito laboratorio desde que se fue su hermano.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他似乎很害怕出门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que le tiene miedo al mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, ven.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,跟你父亲喝杯咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tómate un café con tu papá.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.50,0:07:32.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:32.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.75,0:07:34.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:34.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.54,0:07:50.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我像你这么大的时候已经遇见你母亲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:50.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Oye, me estaba acordando que yo a tu edad ya había conocido a tu mamá.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.25,0:07:54.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,镇上的人都知道我们俩会在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:54.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y parecía que todo el pueblo sabía que íbamos a estar juntos.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们自己却没察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero nosotros no teníamos ni idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,反正我是没意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,O por lo menos yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,告诉我你为什么整天待在那个房间里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, ¿y tú qué andas haciendo en ese cuarto?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你做那些鱼是要拿去卖钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Es que estás vendiendo esos pescaditos o qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,出去走走吧 奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ve y sal y date una vuelta, Aureliano.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你不能整天把自己关在房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Hay cosas en la vida que tú no vas a encontrar en ese cuarto.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.88,0:08:26.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你还好意思说我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:26.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Me lo dices tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.79,0:08:31.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是你妈妈教你这么说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:31.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Tu mamá te dijo que me dijeras eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.96,0:08:41.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但我们的情况不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:41.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,La cosa es que, a diferencia tuya…
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.42,0:08:46.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我在醉心实验之前已经充实地生活过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:46.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,yo viví una vida entera antes de encerrarme aquí.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,若非如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y, si no fuera por eso,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就不会有马孔多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,no existiría Macondo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.67,0:08:53.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不会有你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:53.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ni tú.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.21,0:08:55.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,或者你所见的一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:55.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ni nada de lo que tú has visto.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.21,0:09:12.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,出去走走吧 反正你那些鱼又跑不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:12.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vete y date una vuelta, que los pescaditos no van para ningún lado.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-晚上好-晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenas. - Buenas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我要一升酸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Me despacha un litro de ácido?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还要一些金箔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y unas láminas de oro.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Muchas gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲、丽贝卡 开饭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Amaranta, Rebeca! ¡A comer!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,U、A…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,"U… A…".
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.46,0:09:59.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-别在这儿写 阿尔卡蒂奥 去拿勺子-U
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:59.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,En la mesa no, Arcadio. Ve por cuchara.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔乌雷！把丽贝卡带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Cataure! ¡Trae a Rebeca!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,需要我帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Te ayudo, papá.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不用 我快完事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No, hijo. Ya está cuadrado.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.21,0:10:23.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你怎么回事？瞧阿玛兰妲系着发带多好看呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:23.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Qué cosa contigo. ¿No ves lo linda que se ve Amaranta?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,已经一整天了 丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ya es un día, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.46,0:10:48.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 全镇的人都知道我们家的山药汤最美味了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:48.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca… Todo Macondo sabe que acá se sirve la mejor sopa de ñame.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.79,0:10:49.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,尝尝看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:49.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pruébala.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.29,0:11:04.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不吃完就别下餐桌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:04.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No te paras hasta que comas.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,快吃 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Atrévete, muchachita.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.79,0:11:43.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你想饿死自己 随便你但不许浪费我们的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:43.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Si te quieres morir de hambre no es problema mío, pero en esta casa no se desperdicia la comida.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔乌雷！把袋子拿走！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Cataure! ¡Llévatelo!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.79,0:13:47.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:47.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,抓住她！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Ah! ¡Agárrenla!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Quieta!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Quieta!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.58,0:14:19.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别乱动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:19.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Quieta!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.46,0:14:24.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,要不我们歇会儿吧 夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:24.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y si descansamos un rato, seño?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她不肯守规矩 我只好来硬的了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Es que en esta casa no manda ella, mando yo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.46,0:14:29.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这屎一样的破汤你自己喝去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:29.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Métete tu bebida por el culo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.21,0:14:31.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:31.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué dijo?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.58,0:14:35.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-她说这屎一样的破汤…-出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:35.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Que te metas el brebaje por el… - ¡Afuera!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就一勺 丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Una cucharada, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,吃一勺我就不再烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Una y te dejo en paz.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.58,0:14:49.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你能有什么损失呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:49.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué puedes perder?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.71,0:14:52.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我都是为你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:52.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Lo único que quiero es que estés bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.83,0:15:30.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:30.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias…
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.83,0:15:32.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:32.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,mamá.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.00,0:15:35.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我的好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:35.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mi niña.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.75,0:15:46.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们想听阉鸡的故事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:46.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Quieren que les cuente el cuento del gallo capón?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.79,0:15:47.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,想
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我没让你说“想”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí. - No les dije que me dijeran que sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.54,0:15:53.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我是问你们想不想听阉鸡的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:53.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Les dije que si querían que les contara el cuento del gallo capón.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.21,0:15:55.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那就不想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:55.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Entonces, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我也没让你说“那就不想”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No les dije que me dijeran "entonces, no".
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.12,0:16:02.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我问你们想不想听阉鸡的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:02.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Les dije que si querían que les contara el cuento del gallo capón.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别闹了 丽贝卡 他们快被你逼疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ya está bueno, Rebeca. Los vas a volver locos.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.08,0:16:08.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:08.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Hay más?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.08,0:16:08.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还要？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:08.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Otro?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias, mamá.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,妹妹 你怎么不吃呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿No vas a comer, hermanita?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.92,0:16:17.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这可是全马孔多最美味的山药汤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:17.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es la mejor sopa de ñame de todo Macondo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.42,0:16:19.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是吗？你往里面加了土吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:19.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, ¿sí? ¿Le echaste tierra o qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.08,0:16:20.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:20.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Amaranta!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,快吃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Hazlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.54,0:16:49.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔乌雷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:49.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Cataure.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你听见那个声音了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Escuchas ese ruido?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.17,0:16:58.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,肯定是有动物溜进栅栏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:16:58.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es un animal que entró al corral.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔乌雷 快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Cataure, levántate. Levántate.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.08,0:17:56.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:56.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Rebeca?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,比西塔西翁和卡塔乌雷从那双眼睛里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,reconocieron en esos ojos
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.33,0:18:05.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,认出了一种可怕的疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:05.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,los síntomas de una terrible enfermedad.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.17,0:18:15.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔乌雷从此再也没在家里出现过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:15.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,huyó de la casa para siempre.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那是失眠症
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Era la peste del insomnio.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你都离开家乡那么久了 别胡言乱语
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ya llevas mucho tiempo fuera de tu pueblo. Deja de creer esos cuentos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.08,0:18:31.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这不是胡言乱语 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:31.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No es ningún cuento, señor.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,比西塔西翁…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ay, Visitación…
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡No!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别把手指头伸进去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No metas el dedo dentro de eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别大惊小怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Estás exagerando.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.04,0:18:52.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我没有大惊小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:52.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No estoy exagerando.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,夫人 听我说！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Escúcheme, seño!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.79,0:18:57.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一旦哪户人家被这种疫症侵袭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.79,0:18:57.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Una vez que la peste entra a la casa,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.75,0:19:00.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就谁都别想睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:00.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,nadie vuelve a dormir.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.00,0:19:07.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,比西塔西翁 那只是迷信而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:07.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Son puras supersticiones, Visitación.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就算我们真的再也睡不着觉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero si fuera cierto y no volviéramos a dormir, mejor.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.88,0:19:11.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那岂不正好？
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们可以更多地享受生活
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Así nos rendiría más la vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,待会把做好的糖果拿到广场里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Cuando terminemos, los llevas a la plaza.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.83,0:19:20.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,呼吸点新鲜空气对你有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:20.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,La brisa te va a caer bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.88,0:19:25.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,小动物糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:25.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Animalitos de caramelo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.12,0:19:29.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,小动物糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:29.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Animalitos de caramelo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.96,0:19:40.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,小动物糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:40.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Animalitos de caramelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.21,0:19:43.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,小动物糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:43.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Animalitos de caramelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.12,0:19:50.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:50.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.75,0:19:53.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢啦 丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:53.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.83,0:20:41.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,布恩迪亚一家并没有丝毫担忧直到失眠的第三天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:41.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,hasta el tercer día sin sueño.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.62,0:21:18.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,多出这大把时间我们有好多事可以做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:18.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Imagínate lo que vamos a hacer con todo este tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.42,0:21:31.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-在广场种满杏仁树吧！-没错 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.42,0:21:31.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Vamos a llenar esta plaza de almendros! - Así es, compadre.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.50,0:21:42.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我赢了！14比12-什么？不！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:42.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Ahí tienes! - ¿Qué? ¡No, eso no es! Catorce a doce. Catorce a doce.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.08,0:22:07.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这一疾病的最可怕之处不在于令人无法入睡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:07.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,no era la imposibilidad de dormir,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.38,0:22:10.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,因为身体并不会感到疲倦…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:10.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,pues el cuerpo no sentía cansancio alguno…
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.58,0:22:16.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,爸爸！递给我那个…那什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:16.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Papá! Pásame el… El…
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.83,0:22:19.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.83,0:22:19.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿El qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.42,0:22:28.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,…而在于它会不可避免地恶化到更严重的境地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:28.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,hacia un estado más crítico.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,失忆
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.08,0:22:38.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（杏仁树）
Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺开发了一套
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aureliano concibió la fórmula
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.54,0:22:44.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,抵御失忆的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:44.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que había de defenderlos de las evasiones de la memoria.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.96,0:22:51.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（墙壁）
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（铁砧）
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.21,0:22:56.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就这样他们继续在不断流逝的现实中生活
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:56.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Así continuaron viviendo una realidad escurridiza.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.71,0:23:00.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,只是一旦文字的含义也被遗忘
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:00.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Momentáneamente capturada por las palabras,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（炉灶：用于烹饪所有食物必须加热）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.58,0:23:06.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这般靠词语暂时维系的现实也终将一去不返
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:06.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que había de fugarse cuando olvidaran los valores de la letra escrita.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.17,0:23:10.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,然后他们开始遗忘事物的名称和概念
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:10.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Luego el nombre y la noción de las cosas.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.29,0:23:13.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（鸡蛋：鸡生产出的食物）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（用火点燃这些蜡烛）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（不要在街上尿尿 别人会生气）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.71,0:23:19.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（路灯）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.25,0:23:23.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（每天早晨给奶牛挤奶）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:23.67,0:23:25.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（把牛奶煮熟再用来冲咖啡）
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,伙计 情况越来越失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Compadre, esto se está complicando.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.71,0:23:38.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.71,0:23:38.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y tú quién eres?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.75,0:23:41.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你不认识我了吗 老弟？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.75,0:23:41.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo así que no me reconoces, hermano?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.79,0:23:43.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,强奸啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:43.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Violador! ¡Violador!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.17,0:23:49.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,强奸犯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.17,0:23:49.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Violador! ¡Violador! ¡Violador!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,伊莎贝尔 冷静 他是你丈夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Isabel, tranquila! ¡Es tu marido!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.50,0:23:57.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:57.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Suéltame!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.83,0:24:23.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔利诺！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.83,0:24:23.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Catarino!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.75,0:24:29.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（卡塔利诺）
Dialogue: 10,0:24:31.12,0:24:33.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,顾客就该喝酒！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:33.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Quiero tener clientes que chupen!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.33,0:24:46.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（马孔多-上帝存在）
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.54,0:24:49.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,乌尔苏拉！快带上孩子们！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.54,0:24:49.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Úrsula! ¡Agarra a los niños!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.67,0:24:51.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,嘿 布恩迪亚！
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.67,0:24:58.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,或许你那只公鸡能帮上你妻子的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:58.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,A ver si por fin ese gallo le hace el favor a tu mujer.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.04,0:25:00.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,回家拿武器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:00.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vete para tu casa y ármate, que te voy a matar.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.58,0:25:02.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 10,0:25:05.21,0:25:06.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,普鲁邓希奥？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.21,0:25:06.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Prudencio?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.29,0:25:12.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,到最后失眠症将剥夺病人的自我意识
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.29,0:25:12.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,la peste del insomnio se llevaba la conciencia del propio ser
Dialogue: 10,0:25:12.92,0:25:15.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,使其沦为没有过去的白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:15.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,hasta hundirse en una especie de idiotez sin pasado.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.75,0:25:18.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥！出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.75,0:25:18.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡José Arcadio! ¿Qué está pasando?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:19.88,0:25:20.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.88,0:25:20.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Tú quién eres?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.75,0:25:30.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他变成吉普赛人了
Dialogue: 10,0:25:40.50,0:25:42.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,回家告诉你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.50,0:25:42.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vete para la casa y cuéntale a tu papá.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.00,0:26:01.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.00,0:26:01.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué se siente?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.75,0:26:04.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好像地震一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.75,0:26:04.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es como un temblor de tierra.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.04,0:26:26.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,失去所有异能的梅尔基亚德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:26.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,de toda facultad sobrenatural,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:27.88,0:26:30.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,回到了马孔多
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.88,0:26:30.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Melquíades volvió a Macondo.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.50,0:26:34.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他切实经历过死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:34.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,En efecto había estado en la muerte,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.83,0:26:39.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但又死而复生因为那份孤独令他难以忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.83,0:26:39.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,pero había regresado porque no pudo soportar la soledad.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.12,0:26:48.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（门）
Dialogue: 10,0:26:52.33,0:26:54.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（座椅）
Dialogue: 10,0:27:13.92,0:27:14.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,请问您找谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.92,0:27:14.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿A quién busca?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:00.00,0:28:01.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:01.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y este lugar qué es?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:03.33,0:28:05.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你的炼金实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:05.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es tu laboratorio de alquimia.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:07.04,0:28:07.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我的实验室？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.04,0:28:07.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Mi laboratorio? - Shh…
Dialogue: 10,0:28:23.38,0:28:24.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,梅尔基亚德斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.38,0:28:24.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Melquíades!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:26.08,0:28:27.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.08,0:28:27.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pensé que habías muerto.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:30.71,0:28:31.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:31.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Siéntate.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.62,0:28:34.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.62,0:28:34.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:47.54,0:28:50.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（柱子）
Dialogue: 10,0:29:48.67,0:29:51.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（晒久了太阳我会生气）
Dialogue: 10,0:30:28.92,0:30:31.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（椅子）
Dialogue: 10,0:30:41.04,0:30:45.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（墨水池）
Dialogue: 10,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你说这东西能捕捉时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Dices que este aparato captura el tiempo?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,怎么捕捉 梅尔基亚德斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo es eso, Melquíades?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:24.54,0:31:26.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,根本不可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:26.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Eso es imposible.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:27.50,0:31:29.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,耐心点 何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.50,0:31:29.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tienes que tener paciencia, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:30.21,0:31:32.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你会亲眼见证的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:32.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Lo vas a ver por tus propios ojos.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:32.71,0:31:33.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,乌尔苏拉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.71,0:31:33.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Úrsula!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:34.42,0:31:35.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我们准备好了-来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.42,0:31:35.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ya estamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:40.12,0:31:41.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.12,0:31:41.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Aureliano, ven!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:43.46,0:31:48.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺一转眼已经长大开始穿他父亲的衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.46,0:31:48.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,se había estirado tanto que empezó a usar la ropa de su padre,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:49.67,0:31:53.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他的呼吸声很轻 在与梅尔基亚德斯共用的那间作坊里几不可闻
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.67,0:31:53.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,y apenas se le oía respirar en el taller que compartía con Melquíades.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:55.67,0:31:57.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡出落得最为标致
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.67,0:31:57.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca era la más bella.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:58.12,0:32:03.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,拥有完美无瑕的皮肤和大大的眼睛她的双手仿佛具有魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:32:03.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tenía un cutis diáfano, los ojos grandes y las manos mágicas
Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.67,0:32:07.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,用看得见的丝线绣出精美的花样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.67,0:32:07.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que parecían elaborar con hilos visibles la trama del bordado.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:07.33,0:32:08.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.33,0:32:08.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Rebeca, ven acá!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:10.58,0:32:12.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲则有些相貌平平
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:12.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,era un poco sin gracia,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:13.25,0:32:15.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但天然有种与众不同的气质
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.25,0:32:15.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,pero tenía la distinción natural,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.38,0:32:18.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那是承袭自她已故的祖母佩绰妮拉的端庄得体
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.38,0:32:18.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,el estiramiento interior de Petronila, la abuela muerta.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.50,0:32:19.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.50,0:32:19.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Amaranta, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:20.58,0:32:23.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,虽然展现出了如父亲一般的动手能力…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.58,0:32:23.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,el impulso físico de su padre…
Dialogue: 10,0:32:23.75,0:32:24.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡蒂奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.75,0:32:24.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Arcadio!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:25.42,0:32:29.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,…但阿尔卡蒂奥的外表宛如孩童还有人说他的背影像女人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.42,0:32:29.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,… y decían que tenía las nalgas de mujer.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:33.08,0:32:33.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.08,0:32:33.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Muy bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:35.75,0:32:37.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,等一下 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.75,0:32:37.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Así… acá. Así.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:40.08,0:32:42.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,比西塔西翁不是照你的尺寸缝了几条裤子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:42.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Visitación no te había cortado un pantalón más ancho?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:42.58,0:32:43.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,对 几个月前缝的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:43.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí, hace unos meses, sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:45.17,0:32:46.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,去换条裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.17,0:32:46.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ve y cámbiate.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:47.92,0:32:49.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,快去 何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.92,0:32:49.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ve. José Arcadio. ¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:50.21,0:32:51.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 10,0:32:52.21,0:32:53.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.21,0:32:53.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y esa cara?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:53.96,0:32:54.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.96,0:32:54.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:55.62,0:32:57.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你看起来像个受惊的将军
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.62,0:32:57.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pareces un general asustado.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:07.62,0:33:08.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你不拍吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.62,0:33:08.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:09.50,0:33:10.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.50,0:33:10.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No, yo no.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:10.88,0:33:12.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这玩意要是真能捕捉时间
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.88,0:33:12.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Si ese aparato hace lo que dices,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.00,0:33:15.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我可不想被人当成笑话铭记
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.00,0:33:15.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,no voy a quedar para burla de mis nietos.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.29,0:33:19.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.29,0:33:19.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Quietos todos.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:32.62,0:33:34.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好的 拍好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.62,0:33:34.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, ya está, señores.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:01.08,0:34:02.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.08,0:34:02.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:03.75,0:34:06.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,去阿拉伯人的商店买些水银来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.75,0:34:06.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ve a la tienda del árabe a por mercurio.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.75,0:34:09.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,愿意做我的助手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:09.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Quieres ser mi asistente?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:09.96,0:34:10.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.96,0:34:10.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí, claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:25.50,0:34:27.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别着急 小心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.50,0:34:27.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Despacio, con cuidado.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:29.29,0:34:30.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,再等一小会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.29,0:34:30.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bien. Un poco más.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:31.88,0:34:34.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-好了-好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.88,0:34:34.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Ya! ¿Ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:34.75,0:34:35.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-好了-完美
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.75,0:34:35.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:37.17,0:34:38.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,下一步
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.17,0:34:38.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:39.29,0:34:42.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一定要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.29,0:34:42.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y ahora, con mucho cuidado.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:42.12,0:34:43.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,动作要慢…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:43.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Despacio.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.42,0:34:49.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 10,0:34:50.79,0:34:51.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们一家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.79,0:34:51.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Voilà
Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.29,0:34:57.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,来把它晾干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.29,0:34:57.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos al secado.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:59.58,0:35:03.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,既然这东西能揭示时间和空间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.58,0:35:03.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Si este aparato contiene el tiempo y el espacio
Dialogue: 10,0:35:04.79,0:35:06.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,以及其间存在的所有事物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.79,0:35:06.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,y todo lo que hay en medio…
Dialogue: 10,0:35:08.25,0:35:09.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那通过它应该能看见上帝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.25,0:35:09.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,entonces puede capturar a Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:14.75,0:35:18.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我知道你渴望看见上帝但那种事你就别想了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.75,0:35:18.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sabía que te iba a gustar el aparato, pero sácate esa idea de la cabeza.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:18.75,0:35:19.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,教我怎么操作它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.75,0:35:19.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Enséñame a usarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,教教我！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Enséñame a usarlo!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:21.62,0:35:22.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.62,0:35:22.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Está bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:22.96,0:35:24.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,把底板晾干
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.96,0:35:24.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Seca la placa.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:25.08,0:35:26.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,首先要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.08,0:35:26.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué es lo primero?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:26.58,0:35:28.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-抛光-抛光
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.58,0:35:28.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pulimos. Pulimos…
Dialogue: 10,0:35:28.33,0:35:29.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-这是照片底板-好的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.33,0:35:29.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ahí tenemos la placa. Sí…
Dialogue: 10,0:35:30.58,0:35:33.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,按照白、红、黑的顺序上色
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.58,0:35:33.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,El orden es blanco, rojo y negro.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.00,0:35:36.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.00,0:35:36.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Despacio.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.88,0:35:41.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好 白色够了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:41.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bien. Pasa el blanco.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:48.79,0:35:49.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.79,0:35:49.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Dale al negro.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:51.38,0:35:53.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这张银版相片
Dialogue: 10,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是全家唯一的合照
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,el único que existió jamás,
Dialogue: 10,0:35:57.71,0:36:00.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,照片中的奥雷里亚诺目光如炬
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.71,0:36:00.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aureliano tenía la misma mirada clarividente
Dialogue: 10,0:36:00.50,0:36:04.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,与多年以后面对行刑队时一般无二
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.50,0:36:04.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que había de tener años más tarde frente al pelotón de fusilamiento.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:07.04,0:36:10.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但当时的他还没预感到命运的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.04,0:36:10.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero aún no había sentido la premonición de su destino.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:12.88,0:36:14.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-看-快看
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.88,0:36:14.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mira. Ey, mira.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:15.54,0:36:17.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺！过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:17.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Ajá, Aureliano! ¡Ven acá!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:18.88,0:36:22.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你居然舍得出门了真是奇迹啊 朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.88,0:36:22.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Compadre! ¿Y ese milagro que estás afuera, compadre?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:22.29,0:36:25.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,格林列尔多一大早就见你酒醒了才是奇迹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.29,0:36:25.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No, milagro verte a ti sobrio a esta hora, Gerineldo.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:25.25,0:36:27.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他终于肯出来转转 就别挖苦他了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.25,0:36:27.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Deja de molestarlo, que por fin está aquí. ¿Cómo estás? Qué gusto verte.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:27.54,0:36:28.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,最近可好？
Dialogue: 10,0:36:29.04,0:36:30.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,都挺好 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.04,0:36:30.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bien, Magnífico. ¿Y tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:30.29,0:36:31.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.29,0:36:31.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bien, muy bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:32.33,0:36:33.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,家里没油了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.33,0:36:33.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Se te acabó el aceite.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:34.50,0:36:36.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,有些人是有工作要忙的 懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.50,0:36:36.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, es que algunos sí trabajamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:36.42,0:36:40.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,连跟朋友一起喝朗姆酒都没时间埋头工作还有什么意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.42,0:36:40.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Para qué te sirve ese poco de plata si no puedes tomarte un ron con tus amigos?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:44.58,0:36:46.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,卡塔利诺！看看谁来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.58,0:36:46.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Catarino! ¡Mira quién está aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:47.00,0:36:50.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 你小子可真是赏心悦目
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:50.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Aurelito, mijo! ¡Dichosos los ojos que te ven!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:50.62,0:36:52.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-卡塔利诺-你随意 别拘束
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:52.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ajá, Catarino. Bienvenido.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:53.17,0:36:54.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你家人还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.17,0:36:54.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo están por la casa? - Muy bien, ¿tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:54.46,0:36:55.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,都好 你呢？
Dialogue: 10,0:36:55.46,0:36:56.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 10,0:36:56.50,0:36:58.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-代我向你父母问好-好的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.50,0:36:58.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Muy bien. Oye, me saludas a tu papá. Claro que sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,劳驾 三杯朗姆酒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sírvenos tres, hazme el favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:00.46,0:37:04.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,先生们！只在马孔多待几天！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.46,0:37:04.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Hombres! ¡Por pocos días en Macondo!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:04.79,0:37:09.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,举世无双的艾伦蒂拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:09.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡La única, la mejor! ¡Eréndira!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:09.50,0:37:13.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,只要20分钱就能与她共度良辰！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.50,0:37:13.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Y solo vale 20 centavos!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:13.46,0:37:15.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,清纯少女艾伦蒂拉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.46,0:37:15.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,La Cándida Eréndira.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:15.58,0:37:17.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那个混血姑娘是镇上的话题人物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.58,0:37:17.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es la mulata de la que todo el mundo está hablando.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:18.25,0:37:21.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,据说她很漂亮 是个尤物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.25,0:37:21.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Dicen que es bellísima, tremenda mujer.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:21.29,0:37:22.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,去试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.29,0:37:22.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Te vas a animar?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:22.54,0:37:23.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢
Dialogue: 10,0:37:23.46,0:37:24.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,什么叫“不了”？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.46,0:37:24.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No, hombre, gracias. - ¿Cómo que no?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:24.75,0:37:27.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,布恩迪亚怎能错过如此美妙的体验？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.75,0:37:27.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No puede ser que un Buendía no pase por su cama.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:28.88,0:37:30.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:30.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ay, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:31.12,0:37:32.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你还是处男！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.12,0:37:32.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tú sigues virgen.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:33.75,0:37:36.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我们这就去解决这个问题-你是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.75,0:37:36.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Tú sigues virgen! Vamos, que arreglamos eso hoy mismo.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:37.50,0:37:39.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-谢谢-别走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.50,0:37:39.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Muchas gracias. - Ven. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:40.46,0:37:41.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 10,0:37:41.25,0:37:44.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我只想买些用品-什么？晚点再买呗！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:44.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos para allá… - No. Sí, pero que yo venía por ácido.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:44.12,0:37:44.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.12,0:37:44.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Tranquilo! ¡Qué ácido!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-快去！-好了！我自己去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Bueno! ¡Ya! Yo puedo solo. - ¡Ve, ve!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:58.58,0:38:00.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,动作快点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.58,0:38:00.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No te demores.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:23.54,0:38:24.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是朋友撺掇我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.54,0:38:24.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Me hicieron entrar.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:25.92,0:38:29.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,外面的人收了我20分钱让我快点出去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.92,0:38:29.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Me dijeron que echara 20 centavos en la alcancía y que no me demorara.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:34.42,0:38:38.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你可以多待会儿出去时再付20分就好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.42,0:38:38.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Si echas otros 20 a la salida, te puedes quedar más tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:36.83,0:39:37.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.83,0:39:37.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Para.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:39.71,0:39:41.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我做错什么了吗？-没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.71,0:39:41.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Hice algo que te molestó? - No.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:43.04,0:39:43.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:43.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No es eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:50.38,0:39:51.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你有时间休息吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.38,0:39:51.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿No descansas?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:56.50,0:39:58.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,等我还完欠祖母的钱就能休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.50,0:39:58.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Descansaré cuando le pague a mi abuela.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是说外面那个女人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿La mujer que está afuera?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:08.96,0:40:12.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,大约两年前
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.96,0:40:12.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Hace como dos años,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:13.67,0:40:15.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我没熄灭蜡烛就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.67,0:40:15.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,me quedé dormida con la vela prendida.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:18.00,0:40:20.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,醒来时周围已经是一片火海
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:20.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Cuando me desperté, estaba envuelta en candela.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:22.04,0:40:23.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,整座房子都被烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.04,0:40:23.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,La casa quedó hecha ceniza.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:28.21,0:40:29.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你欠了多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.21,0:40:29.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y cuánto le debes?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:32.71,0:40:34.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,按目前的情况来算
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.71,0:40:34.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Así como vamos,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:35.33,0:40:36.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一晚70个男人的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.33,0:40:36.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,setenta hombres por noche…
Dialogue: 10,0:40:38.75,0:40:41.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,要干十年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.75,0:40:41.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,por diez años.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:45.50,0:40:46.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:46.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Eres hermosa.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:51.92,0:40:52.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.92,0:40:52.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:03.58,0:41:05.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我会支付20比索
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.58,0:41:05.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Entonces, echaré 20 pesos.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:07.67,0:41:09.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,可那是好多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.67,0:41:09.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero eso es bastante.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:10.17,0:41:11.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,相当于一百个客人了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.17,0:41:11.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Son cien hombres.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:33.58,0:41:34.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.58,0:41:34.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué te pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:35.17,0:41:36.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.17,0:41:36.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:37.75,0:41:38.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.75,0:41:38.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Estás bien?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:39.17,0:41:40.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.17,0:41:40.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:40.92,0:41:43.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡蒂奥 你去作坊看书吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.92,0:41:43.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Arcadio, si quieres leer, vete para el taller.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:43.83,0:41:44.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我累了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:44.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Estoy cansado.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:52.83,0:41:53.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.83,0:41:53.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aureliano.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:57.29,0:41:58.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,虽然太过久远 我记不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.29,0:41:58.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Yo no me acuerdo, pero…
Dialogue: 10,0:42:01.04,0:42:03.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但比西塔西翁总说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.04,0:42:03.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Visitación siempre habla
Dialogue: 10,0:42:03.92,0:42:06.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你当时好几个月前就预感到了丽贝卡会来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:06.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,de cómo viste la llegada de Rebeca meses antes.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.17,0:42:10.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.17,0:42:10.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Es cierto?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:11.75,0:42:12.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.75,0:42:12.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:19.25,0:42:20.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你也有预感到我会来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.25,0:42:20.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿También viste la mía?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:28.08,0:42:29.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.08,0:42:29.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Todos,
Dialogue: 10,0:42:29.71,0:42:32.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这世间的每一个人都是孤独无依
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.71,0:42:32.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,absolutamente todos, estamos solos en este mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:35.54,0:42:38.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,即使知道你的父母是谁也不会带来任何改变
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.54,0:42:38.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y saber quiénes son tus padres no va a hacer ninguna diferencia.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:56.62,0:42:57.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.62,0:42:57.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:00.21,0:43:01.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你都不会害臊的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.21,0:43:01.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿No te da pena estar así? - ¿Pena con quién?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:01.62,0:43:02.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,为什么要害臊？
Dialogue: 10,0:43:03.75,0:43:04.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是我妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.75,0:43:04.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Con mi hermana?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:05.12,0:43:07.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们应当相亲相爱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.12,0:43:07.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Si tú y yo lo que tenemos que ser es cómplices.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:08.29,0:43:11.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不然你去跟男友们约会时谁来给你保密呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.29,0:43:11.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿O quién te guardará los secretos cuando te escapes con tus novios?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:12.67,0:43:14.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,男友们？你胡说什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.67,0:43:14.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cuáles novios? Estás loca.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:18.25,0:43:19.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.25,0:43:19.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mira.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:19.79,0:43:22.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,只要你出去散个步
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.79,0:43:22.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,De seguro que pongas un pie en la calle,
Dialogue: 10,0:43:23.67,0:43:25.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一定会吸引所有男人的目光
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.67,0:43:25.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,te van a caer encima como moscas.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:33.08,0:43:34.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不 丽贝卡 别闹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.08,0:43:34.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No, Rebeca. Ven.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:34.88,0:43:39.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,毛巾！把毛巾给我 丽贝卡 还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.88,0:43:39.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Dame la toalla! ¡Rebeca, dame la toalla! ¡Rebeca! ¡Dame la toalla!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:40.33,0:43:41.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们吵什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.33,0:43:41.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y ustedes por qué están así?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:42.83,0:43:44.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还都光着身子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:44.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Desvestidas?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:45.67,0:43:51.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,乌尔苏拉意识到女儿们已经到了适婚的年龄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.67,0:43:51.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,de que sus hijas estaban en edad de casarse.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:51.71,0:43:55.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,犹如感染了丈夫的头脑发热
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.71,0:43:55.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y como si hubiera contraído la fiebre alucinante de su esposo,
Dialogue: 10,0:43:56.38,0:43:58.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她开始以扩建家宅为己任
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:58.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,se dio a la tarea de la ampliación de la casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:58.83,0:44:00.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好了 小伙子们！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.83,0:44:00.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Bueno, muchachos!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:00.67,0:44:04.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我需要一间设有一张12人餐桌的餐厅 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.67,0:44:04.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Necesito un comedor para una mesa de 12 puestos.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:04.96,0:44:07.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好 去吧 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.96,0:44:07.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Sí? Bueno. A ver, pasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:08.38,0:44:09.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这边这个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.38,0:44:09.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aquí. En este salón de aquí.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:10.54,0:44:13.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,要从维也纳买家具来精心布置这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.54,0:44:13.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Aquí quiero una sala decorada con muebles vieneses,
Dialogue: 10,0:44:13.96,0:44:17.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好让我们举办本地最盛大的宴会
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.96,0:44:17.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,para hacer las fiestas más distinguidas de la ciénaga, ¿sí?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:18.08,0:44:19.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他们能听明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.08,0:44:19.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Están entendiendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:23.12,0:44:24.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:24.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Vengan para acá.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:30.42,0:44:33.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,真烦人 扫得我累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.42,0:44:33.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Jodes o molestas, estoy cansada de tanto barrer.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:42.33,0:44:44.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,九个房间 窗户都要对着院子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.33,0:44:44.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Por acá. Y nueve cuartos con las ventanas hacia el patio.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:44.71,0:44:47.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,分别开设男女浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.71,0:44:47.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Quiero baños para los hombres, baños para las mujeres,
Dialogue: 10,0:44:47.62,0:44:49.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,还要一间带两个炉灶的厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.62,0:44:49.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,y una cocina donde pueda tener dos hornos. ¿Está claro?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:50.08,0:44:50.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-明白吗？-明白
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.08,0:44:50.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Está claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:58.75,0:45:00.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,快过去！别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.75,0:45:00.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pasa, pasa. ¡Quietos todos!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:03.88,0:45:04.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.88,0:45:04.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Quieto!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:20.29,0:45:22.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（马孔多）
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.83,0:46:13.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,您好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.83,0:46:13.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:14.58,0:46:16.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,您是布恩迪亚夫人乌尔苏拉·伊瓜兰吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.58,0:46:16.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Señora Úrsula Iguarán de Buendía?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:16.83,0:46:17.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.83,0:46:17.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:19.62,0:46:21.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,在下皮耶特·克雷斯皮 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.62,0:46:21.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Soy Pietro Crespi, un placer.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:21.58,0:46:23.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我带来了您从首都订的货
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.58,0:46:23.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,He traído su encargo de la capital.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:42.83,0:46:44.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,喝点柠檬水吧 克莱斯皮先生
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.83,0:46:44.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Le traje limonada, señor Crespi.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:45.08,0:46:46.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.08,0:46:46.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mil gracias, señora.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:48.38,0:46:50.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,需要多长时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.38,0:46:50.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cuánto tiempo va a demorar eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:53.46,0:46:57.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,女士 我也说不好 这是很复杂的乐器
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.46,0:46:57.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Señora, más o menos… El instrumento es complicado.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:57.88,0:46:59.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,得花些时间调试
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.88,0:46:59.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Entonces lleva un tiempo…
Dialogue: 10,0:47:02.42,0:47:03.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,二位小姐 抱歉 我先前没看见你们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.42,0:47:03.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Señoritas, disculpen.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:06.25,0:47:09.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们好 在下皮耶特·克雷斯皮 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.25,0:47:09.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenos días. Pietro Crespi, un placer.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:11.29,0:47:12.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我是丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.29,0:47:12.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Yo soy Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:12.75,0:47:14.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我是阿玛兰妲·布恩迪亚 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.75,0:47:14.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y yo, Amaranta Buendía. Mucho gusto.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:16.29,0:47:17.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.29,0:47:17.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bienvenido.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:18.38,0:47:19.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,荣幸之至
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.38,0:47:19.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Encantado.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:28.46,0:47:30.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,到底要多长时间呢 克莱斯皮先…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.46,0:47:30.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No dijo cuánto tiempo se iba a demorar.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:30.67,0:47:33.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,大约需要一周 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.67,0:47:33.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Señora, más o menos una semana.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:34.71,0:47:37.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好吗？若您允许的话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.71,0:47:37.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Sí? Pero si usted me permite,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:38.50,0:47:40.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我正好可以教您的女儿们跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.50,0:47:40.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,podría enseñarles a sus hijas a bailar.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:41.08,0:47:44.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,您知道我的服务包含了舞蹈课吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.08,0:47:44.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No sé si le contaron que las clases estaban incluidas con el instrumento.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:45.83,0:47:48.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这样啊 不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.83,0:47:48.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Mmm. Ya. Bueno, no es necesario, pero le agradezco mucho.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:49.00,0:47:50.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 10,0:47:50.62,0:47:52.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-当然-可那不是正好嘛 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.62,0:47:52.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Como diga. Pero sería perfecto.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:52.54,0:47:55.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你不是说我们要办温居宴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.54,0:47:55.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Nos dijiste que íbamos a dar una fiesta para estrenar la casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:55.92,0:47:57.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,到时候会有舞会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.92,0:47:57.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y para presentarnos en sociedad.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:01.29,0:48:02.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.29,0:48:02.21,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你们上课时阿尔卡蒂奥会全程陪同
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero Arcadio siempre tiene que estar acompañándolas.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:06.88,0:48:08.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不许有身体接触
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.88,0:48:08.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y nada de tocarse.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:09.08,0:48:09.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.08,0:48:09.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Por supuesto.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:10.88,0:48:12.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,就这么定了 让他干正事去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.88,0:48:12.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, ya. Déjenlo trabajar.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:16.79,0:48:22.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥不懈地追寻着上帝那无所不在、无迹可寻的踪迹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.79,0:48:22.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,perseguía el rastro invisible de Dios en todas las cosas,
Dialogue: 10,0:48:24.83,0:48:26.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,而彼得罗则继续着他的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.83,0:48:26.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pietro continuó trabajando
Dialogue: 10,0:48:26.67,0:48:29.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,其专注程度不亚于奥雷里亚诺在工作室里的投入
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.67,0:48:29.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,con una consagración similar a la de Aureliano en su taller.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:40.58,0:48:42.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,（速度标记）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.58,0:48:42.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,INDICADOR DE TEMPO
Dialogue: 10,0:49:07.79,0:49:09.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你怎么了 何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.79,0:49:09.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué es lo que pasa, José Arcadio?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:10.92,0:49:13.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我从这里都感觉到你的郁闷了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.92,0:49:13.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No tienes que hablar para escucharte alegando.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:14.17,0:49:15.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.17,0:49:15.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es que no aparece.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:17.62,0:49:18.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.62,0:49:18.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué no aparece?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:22.62,0:49:24.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,没道理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.62,0:49:24.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No puede ser que haya capturado
Dialogue: 10,0:49:25.21,0:49:27.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我拍遍了整个马孔多
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.21,0:49:27.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,cada rincón de Macondo,
Dialogue: 10,0:49:27.83,0:49:30.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,上帝都没有现身
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.83,0:49:30.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,y Dios no aparece por ningún rincón.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:32.08,0:49:33.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.08,0:49:33.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ay, querido amigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:34.83,0:49:36.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这就是你对上帝的认知吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.83,0:49:36.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Acaso cómo te imaginaste a Dios?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:38.25,0:49:40.21,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们先从仪态开始吧
Dialogue: 10,0:49:40.29,0:49:42.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,放松肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.29,0:49:42.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Comencemos desde la postura. Relajemos los hombros.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:42.38,0:49:43.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,别表现得太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.38,0:49:43.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Al menos disimulen. - Shh.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:44.83,0:49:47.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,向前伸展手臂 记住这节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.83,0:49:47.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Alarguemos los brazos, y recuerden:
Dialogue: 10,0:49:47.25,0:49:52.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一、二、三…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.25,0:49:52.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,uno, dos, tres, uno, dos, tres, uno, dos, tres.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:55.00,0:49:55.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 10,0:49:55.92,0:49:57.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.92,0:49:57.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Uno, dos, tres. Muy bien. Uno, dos, tres.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:57.33,0:49:58.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,现在结对练习
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.33,0:49:58.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ahora en pareja.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:00.54,0:50:05.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一、二、三…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.54,0:50:05.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Uno, dos, tres. Uno, dos, tres. Uno, dos, tres, uno…
Dialogue: 10,0:50:10.62,0:50:11.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.62,0:50:11.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Y eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:40.58,0:50:42.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一定是他在钢琴里面
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.58,0:50:42.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tiene que estar dentro de la pianola.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:44.79,0:50:45.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.79,0:50:45.67,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué cosa?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:46.96,0:50:47.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:47.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:49.08,0:50:51.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥 别瞎说
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.08,0:50:51.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ay, José Arcadio. ¿Qué disparates estás diciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:52.00,0:50:53.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你就一点都不为女儿们操心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.00,0:50:53.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Más bien preocúpate por tus hijas.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:54.67,0:50:57.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我为什么要操心？-为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.67,0:50:57.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Preocuparme por qué? ¿Cómo que por qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-这还不明显吗？-什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿No estás viendo? - ¿Qué cosa?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:03.33,0:51:04.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,她们的品貌
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.33,0:51:04.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Su honra.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:07.62,0:51:10.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你总能有操不完的心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.62,0:51:10.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Tú no sabes qué inventar para estarte preocupando, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:11.25,0:51:12.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这人是个娘娘腔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.25,0:51:12.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ese tipo es marica.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:56.58,0:51:58.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,很荣幸认识你 丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.58,0:51:58.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Ha sido un placer, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:06.71,0:52:07.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.71,0:52:07.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Señorita Amaranta.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:11.71,0:52:14.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,乌尔苏拉女士 谢谢款待
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.71,0:52:14.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Señora Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:14.83,0:52:17.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这次到访很愉快 我一定会再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.83,0:52:17.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias por todo. Ha estado bellísimo. Prometo regresar.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:08.04,0:53:09.12,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你要上床睡觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.04,0:53:09.12,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Vienes a dormir?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:18.88,0:54:20.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你都干了些什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.88,0:54:20.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué hiciste?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:22.88,0:54:25.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-我想看它是如何运作的-过两天就是晚宴了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.88,0:54:25.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Necesitaba saber cómo funciona. - En dos días,
Dialogue: 10,0:54:26.29,0:54:28.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我邀请了我们所有的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.29,0:54:28.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,esta casa se va a llenar de nuestros amigos
Dialogue: 10,0:54:29.21,0:54:30.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他们的儿子也会来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.21,0:54:30.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que van a venir con sus hijos
Dialogue: 10,0:54:31.17,0:54:33.29,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,好让你的女儿能邂逅几个追求者
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.17,0:54:33.29,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,para que tus hijas encuentren pretendientes.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:34.12,0:54:36.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你最好赶在那之前把钢琴给我组装好！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.12,0:54:36.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¡Así que más te vale que esa pianola esté perfecta!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:57.83,0:55:02.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你好 感谢前来 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.83,0:55:02.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenas noches. ¿Cómo están? Gracias por venir. Muchas gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:02.33,0:55:05.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,晚上好 谢谢 亲爱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.33,0:55:05.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenas noches. Muchas gracias. ¡Compadre!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:05.25,0:55:06.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.25,0:55:06.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:06.46,0:55:08.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢 请进
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.46,0:55:08.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias. Sigan, por favor, adelante. Muchas gracias. Sigan.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:09.00,0:55:11.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-谢谢 请进-乌尔苏拉！
Dialogue: 10,0:55:11.25,0:55:14.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你好 晚上好 请进
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.25,0:55:14.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Gracias por la invitación. ¿Cómo está? Buenas noches, gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:14.29,0:55:17.08,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,比西塔西翁 去给客人上点心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.29,0:55:17.08,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Visitación, para irle dando los bizcochos. ¿Bueno?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:30.67,0:55:32.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一晃眼快三十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.67,0:55:32.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Han pasado casi 30 años
Dialogue: 10,0:55:33.92,0:55:36.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,当初我们背井离乡…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.92,0:55:36.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,desde que salimos de esa ranchería.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:38.38,0:55:40.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,选择在这里创建家园
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.38,0:55:40.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y se nos ocurrió levantar este pueblo.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:43.71,0:55:47.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们亲手将一个不毛之地打造成了如今的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.71,0:55:47.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Construirlo con nuestras propias manos en mitad del monte.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:48.33,0:55:50.58,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,在那些前途不明的岁月里多亏有各位的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.33,0:55:50.58,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Quién sabe dónde estaríamos José Arcadio y yo
Dialogue: 10,0:55:51.17,0:55:53.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,否则我和何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥真不知会是何光景
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.17,0:55:53.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,si ustedes no nos hubieran seguido en semejante locura?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:54.46,0:55:58.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,乌尔苏拉 你邀请我们来是为了让大伙儿抱头痛哭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.46,0:55:58.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, ¿y entonces, comadre? ¿Nos invitaste a llorar afuera o qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:59.33,0:56:01.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,当然不是 马尼费科
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.33,0:56:01.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pues claro que no, Magnífico.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:03.62,0:56:06.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,但我想提醒诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.62,0:56:06.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Pero no iba a dejar pasar este momento para decirles
Dialogue: 10,0:56:07.33,0:56:09.04,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,有件事我一直铭记在心
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.33,0:56:09.04,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que a mí no se me olvida
Dialogue: 10,0:56:10.04,0:56:11.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这是我们共同建造的家园
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.04,0:56:11.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que lo que tenemos es de todos.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:13.58,0:56:15.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,如果通过女儿的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:15.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Y que sería un honor
Dialogue: 10,0:56:16.46,0:56:19.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们彼此能成为一家人我将感到万分荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.46,0:56:19.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,que nuestras familias se unieran a través de nuestras hijas.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:20.04,0:56:23.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,话虽如此 也得孩子们愿意挑战跳舞才行 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.04,0:56:23.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, si es que sus muchachos dan la talla para el baile, ¿no?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:30.79,0:56:32.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,那么 舞会开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.79,0:56:32.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Bueno, ¡entonces que empiece el baile!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:31.17,0:57:33.92,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 能跟我跳支舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.17,0:57:33.92,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca. ¿Me concedes esta pieza?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:40.71,0:57:41.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你真美
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.71,0:57:41.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Estás muy bonita. - Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:41.83,0:57:42.67,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 10,0:57:51.21,0:57:53.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我们去给这些人做个示范吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.21,0:57:53.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Les enseñamos a estos cómo se baila?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:10.04,0:58:12.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,不好意思 先生能借用一下你的舞伴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.04,0:58:12.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Perdón, caballero. ¿Me permite?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:35.21,0:58:38.79,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你是全马孔多最美丽的女人丽贝卡·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.21,0:58:38.79,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Eres la mujer más de todo Macondo, Rebeca Buendía.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:39.38,0:58:40.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,彼得罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.38,0:58:40.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Pietro?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:54.50,0:58:55.83,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.50,0:58:55.83,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, ¿estás bien?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:00.50,0:59:01.42,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,儿子 过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.50,0:59:01.42,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Hijo, ven.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:14.38,0:59:16.33,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这一把把泥土
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.38,0:59:16.33,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,hicieron menos remoto y más cierto
Dialogue: 10,0:59:16.42,0:59:19.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,使那唯一值得她自轻自贱的男人
Dialogue: 10,0:59:19.54,0:59:21.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,变得不再遥远也更加真切
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.54,0:59:21.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,al único hombre que merecía aquella degradación.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:03.38,1:00:04.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,你还在生我的气吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.38,1:00:04.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Todavía tienes rabia?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:07.29,1:00:09.62,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我没生你的气 何塞·阿尔卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.29,1:00:09.62,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,No es rabia lo que siento, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:13.54,1:00:14.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,我只是很害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.54,1:00:14.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es miedo.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:31.33,1:00:33.50,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,-这里是布恩迪亚家吗？-是的 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.33,1:00:33.50,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Casa de la familia Buendía? - Sí, señor.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:38.88,1:00:40.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,这是一份急件
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.88,1:00:40.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Es urgente que lo reciba ahora mismo.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:41.25,1:00:42.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,特此通知你们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.25,1:00:42.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Queda notificado.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:43.12,1:00:44.00,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.12,1:00:44.00,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Buenas noches.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:54.42,1:00:55.38,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.42,1:00:55.38,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Disculpen.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:57.21,1:00:58.88,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,一个男人送来了这封信
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.21,1:00:58.88,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Alguien vino a traer esto.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:59.38,1:01:00.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,是一位政府代表
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.38,1:01:00.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Un enviado del gobierno.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:03.04,1:01:04.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,政府代表？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.04,1:01:04.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Un hombre del gobierno?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:04.79,1:01:07.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,他说特此通知我们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.79,1:01:07.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Dijo que quedábamos notificados.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:08.88,1:01:10.46,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,通知？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.88,1:01:10.46,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Notificados?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:13.58,1:01:15.96,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,蓝色 我们需要把自家房子粉刷成蓝色
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.58,1:01:15.96,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,Dice que tenemos que pintar la casa de azul.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:18.08,1:01:19.54,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,真的假的？谁说的？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.08,1:01:19.54,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo es eso? ¿Quién lo dice?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:22.21,1:01:25.75,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚政府指派的马孔多里正
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.21,1:01:25.75,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,El corregidor de Macondo, asignado por el Gobierno Nacional.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:27.17,1:01:28.25,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,里正？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.17,1:01:28.25,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Corregidor?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:29.25,1:01:30.71,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,哪个里正？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.25,1:01:30.71,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Qué corregidor?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:36.75,1:01:39.17,CN-Main,,0,0,0,,阿波利纳尔·摩斯科特是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.75,1:01:39.17,ES-Main,,0,0,0,,¿Quién carajo es Apolinar Moscote?
